<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
  <title>HealthUp+ — Drei Ringe. Faire Liga. Scores auf dem iPhone.</title>
  <meta name="description" content="HealthUp+: Belastung, Erholung, Schlaf und Stress bleiben auf deinem iPhone. Die Liga über Apple iCloud teilt nur Name, Profilbild und Gesamtpunkte. Kein Tracking, keine eigenen Server.">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#071433">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/jpeg" href="data:image/jpeg;base64,">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="data:image/jpeg;base64,">
  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #071433;
      --navy-light: #0d2252;
      --ink: #0f1728;
      --muted: #5b6475;
      --subtle: #8a94a6;
      --line: rgba(15, 23, 40, 0.08);
      --line-dark: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      --paper: #f5f7fb;
      --card-bg: #ffffff;
      --orange: #f07a1a;
      --green: #10b981;
      --blue: #2f6bff;
      --indigo: #6366f1;
      --shadow-sm: 0 4px 12px rgba(7, 20, 51, 0.04);
      --shadow-md: 0 12px 32px -4px rgba(7, 20, 51, 0.08);
      --shadow-lg: 0 24px 60px -12px rgba(7, 20, 51, 0.16);
      --shadow-mockup: 0 30px 70px -15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      --radius-sm: 12px;
      --radius-md: 20px;
      --radius-lg: 28px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
    body {
      color: var(--ink);
      background: var(--paper);
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Display", "SF Pro Text", "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale;
    }

    a { color: var(--blue); text-decoration: none; transition: opacity .15s ease; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

    .wrap {
      width: min(1140px, calc(100% - 44px));
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* Navigation */
    .nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: rgba(245, 247, 251, 0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      transition: background .2s ease;
    }
    .nav-inner {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 14px 0;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.22rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }
    .brand:hover { text-decoration: none; }
    .brand img {
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    }
    .links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 22px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .links a { color: var(--ink); }
    .links a:hover { color: var(--blue); text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-cta {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: #fff !important;
      padding: 8px 18px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      transition: transform .15s ease, opacity .15s ease;
    }
    .nav-cta:hover { opacity: 0.92; transform: translateY(-1px); text-decoration: none; }

    /* Buttons */
    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: var(--ink);
      color: #fff;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 14px 26px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 1rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
      transition: transform .15s ease, opacity .15s ease;
    }
    .btn:hover { text-decoration: none; opacity: 0.94; transform: translateY(-1px); }
    .btn-secondary {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      color: #fff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
      box-shadow: none;
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .btn-light {
      background: #fff;
      color: var(--navy);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .btn-light:hover {
      background: #f8fafc;
      color: var(--navy);
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, #071433 0%, #0d265c 54%, #f5f7fb 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 50px 0 30px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 48px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 6px 14px;
      background: rgba(240, 122, 26, 0.18);
      border: 1px solid rgba(240, 122, 26, 0.4);
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: #ff9838;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.2vw, 4.4rem);
      line-height: 1.04;
      letter-spacing: -0.045em;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .hero-sub {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.88);
      font-size: 1.22rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
      max-width: 44ch;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      font-weight: 400;
    }
    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .trust-badges {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      padding-top: 14px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    }
    .trust-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .trust-icon {
      width: 18px;
      height: 18px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #10b981;
    }
    .hero-phone {
      justify-self: center;
      width: min(380px, 100%);
      position: relative;
    }
    .hero-phone img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 36px 36px 18px 18px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-mockup);
      border: 6px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    }

    /* Section Typography & Layout */
    .section {
      padding: 88px 0;
      position: relative;
    }
    .kicker {
      color: var(--orange);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .section h2 {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.4vw, 3rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      line-height: 1.15;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .sub {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
      max-width: 58ch;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    /* Cards & Shot Grids */
    .grid-3 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .grid-2 {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .shot-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
    }
    .shot-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
    }
    .shot-card .img-frame {
      background: #edf1f8;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: flex-start;
      padding: 18px 18px 0;
    }
    .shot-card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 480px;
      object-fit: cover;
      object-position: top;
      border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(7, 20, 51, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
    }
    .shot-card figcaption {
      padding: 22px 24px 26px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .shot-card figcaption .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      align-self: flex-start;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: rgba(47, 107, 255, 0.08);
      color: var(--blue);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    .shot-card figcaption strong {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .shot-card figcaption p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* Highlight Banner Card */
    .banner-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #071433 0%, #0d265c 100%);
      color: #fff;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 44px;
      margin: 30px 0 60px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
      gap: 36px;
      align-items: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    }
    .banner-card h3 {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 2.6vw, 2.4rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      line-height: 1.15;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .banner-card p {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1.55;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .banner-img {
      justify-self: center;
      width: min(320px, 100%);
    }
    .banner-img img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 22px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      border: 3px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    }

    /* Feature Pillars */
    .pillar-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }
    .pillar-card {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 26px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    }
    .pillar-icon {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 40, 0.04);
    }
    .pillar-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .pillar-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* Action Band */
    .band {
      background: var(--navy);
      color: #fff;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 48px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 32px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
      margin: 40px 0;
    }
    .band-content h3 {
      font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.5vw, 2.2rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .band-content p {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      max-width: 52ch;
    }

    /* Prose Document (Privacy & Legal) */
    .prose {
      background: var(--card-bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 44px 48px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .prose h1 {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin: 12px 0 20px;
    }
    .prose h2 {
      font-size: 1.45rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin: 38px 0 14px;
      padding-top: 14px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .prose h2:first-of-type {
      border-top: none;
      padding-top: 0;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }
    .prose h3 {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 20px 0 8px;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .prose p {
      color: #2d3748;
      font-size: 1.02rem;
      line-height: 1.68;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .prose ul, .prose ol {
      margin: 12px 0 20px 24px;
      color: #2d3748;
    }
    .prose li {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .prose strong {
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .prose .highlight-box {
      background: #f0f4ff;
      border-left: 4px solid var(--blue);
      border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
      padding: 18px 22px;
      margin: 22px 0;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
    }
    .prose .highlight-box p {
      margin-bottom: 0;
      color: #1e3a8a;
    }
    .data-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 20px 0;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
    .data-table th, .data-table td {
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      text-align: left;
    }
    .data-table th {
      background: #f8fafc;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .mail-link {
      font-size: 1.22rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      word-break: break-all;
      display: inline-block;
      margin: 8px 0 16px;
    }

    /* Footer */
    footer {
      padding: 40px 0 60px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    footer a { color: var(--muted); }
    footer a:hover { color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .hero-grid, .banner-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .grid-3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
      .band { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .wrap { width: calc(100% - 32px); }
      .grid-3, .grid-2 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .shot-card img { height: auto; }
      .prose { padding: 28px 22px; }
      .nav-inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
      .links { gap: 14px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Header Navigation -->
<header class="nav">
  <div class="wrap nav-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="#start">
      <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="HealthUp+ Icon">
      HealthUp+
    </a>
    <nav class="links">
      <a href="#heute">Heute</a>
      <a href="#schlaf-stress">Schlaf &amp; Stress</a>
      <a href="#koerper-fitness">Körper &amp; Fitness</a>
      <a href="#liga-arena">Liga</a>
      <a href="#datenschutz">Datenschutz</a>
      <a href="#support">Support</a>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="mailto:healthplus.support.feedback@gmail.com?subject=HealthUp%2B%20Support">Kontakt</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="hero" id="start">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="badge">
        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/></svg>
        Neu für iOS &amp; watchOS
      </div>
      <h1>Drei Ringe.<br>Faire Liga.<br>Scores auf dem iPhone.</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Belastung, Erholung, Schlaf und Stress — präzise und vollständig auf deinem iPhone ausgewertet.
        Keine fremden Server, kein Werbe-Tracking. Die Liga über Apple iCloud teilt nur Name, Profilbild und Gesamtpunkte. Gesundheitsdaten bleiben auf dem iPhone.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn" href="#support">Support anfragen</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="#datenschutz">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>
          Datenschutz prüfen
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="trust-badges">
        <div class="trust-item">
          <span class="trust-icon">✓</span> Scores bleiben auf dem iPhone
        </div>
        <div class="trust-item">
          <span class="trust-icon">✓</span> iCloud nur für die Liga
        </div>
        <div class="trust-item">
          <span class="trust-icon">✓</span> DSGVO-konform &amp; Zero Tracking
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-phone">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="HealthUp+ App Heute Ansicht mit drei Ringen">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<main>

  <!-- Highlight Vision Banner -->
  <section class="wrap">
    <div class="banner-card">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker" style="color:#ff9838">Philosophie</div>
        <h3>Echtes Wohlbefinden statt Zahlenwand.</h3>
        <p>
          Herkömmliche Health-Apps überfordern mit unzähligen Rohwerten oder schicken intimste Vitaldaten in Werbe-Clouds.
          HealthUp+ kondensiert deine biologischen Signale in drei klare Ringe: <strong>Belastung</strong>, <strong>Erholung</strong> und <strong>Schlaf</strong>.
          Kombiniert mit individuellem On-Device-Coaching weißt du morgens sofort, ob dein Körper bereit für Höchstleistungen ist oder aktive Regeneration braucht.
        </p>
        <a class="btn btn-light" href="#heute">Funktionen entdecken</a>
      </div>
      <div class="banner-img">
        <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="HealthUp+ Die bessere Health App">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Showcase 1: Heute, Schlaf & Stress -->
  <section class="section" id="heute" style="padding-top:20px">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="kicker">Der Tag im Einklang</div>
      <h2>Drei Ringe. Sofortige Klarheit.</h2>
      <p class="sub">
        Alle Algorithmen laufen lokal auf deinem iPhone. Dein Erholungs-Score berechnet sich aus Herzfrequenzvariabilität (HRV) und Ruhepuls, dein Schlaf aus validierten Phasen und dein Stress aus physiologischen Treibern.
      </p>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <!-- Heute -->
        <figure class="shot-card">
          <div class="img-frame">
            <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="HealthUp+ Heute Übersicht mit Ringen und Coaching">
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <span class="tag">Heute &amp; Coaching</span>
            <strong>Drei Ringe &amp; Tages-Coach</strong>
            <p>Belastung, Erholung und Schlaf im Gleichgewicht. Täglich ein prägnanter Satz On-Device-Coaching für dein optimales Trainingsfenster.</p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <!-- Schlaf -->
        <figure class="shot-card" id="schlaf-stress">
          <div class="img-frame">
            <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="HealthUp+ Schlafphasen und Ruhepulsverlauf">
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <span class="tag">Schlafanalyse</span>
            <strong>Schlafphasen &amp; Pulsverlauf</strong>
            <p>Dauer, Wachphasen, REM-, Leicht- und Tiefschlaf mit exaktem Ruhepuls-Trend während der Nacht. Für echte regenerative Erholung.</p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <!-- Stress -->
        <figure class="shot-card">
          <div class="img-frame">
            <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="HealthUp+ Stressmonitor">
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <span class="tag">Echtzeit-Monitor</span>
            <strong>Wissenschaftlicher Stress-Score</strong>
            <p>Kontinuierliche Einordnung von Ruhe bis Belastung. Verstehe genau, wie Erholung, Strain und HRV dein vegetatives Nervensystem steuern.</p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Showcase 2: Körper & Fitness -->
  <section class="section" id="koerper-fitness" style="padding-top:20px">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="kicker">Vitalität &amp; Vitaldaten</div>
      <h2>Körper als verlässliche Orientierung.</h2>
      <p class="sub">
        Ganzheitliche Gesundheit ohne diagnostische Bevormundung. HealthUp+ liest deine Apple Health Vitalparameter und stellt Trends strukturiert, ästhetisch und nachvollziehbar dar.
      </p>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <!-- Körper -->
        <figure class="shot-card">
          <div class="img-frame">
            <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="HealthUp+ Gesundheitsmonitor und Körperwerte">
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <span class="tag">Gesundheitsmonitor</span>
            <strong>Ganzheitlicher Status</strong>
            <p>360°-Perspektive auf Herz, Ruhepuls, Körperkomposition und biologisches Alter als Motivationskompass — alles auf deinem Gerät berechnet.</p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <!-- Fitness -->
        <figure class="shot-card">
          <div class="img-frame">
            <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="HealthUp+ Fitness und Vitalwerte">
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <span class="tag">Fitness &amp; Ausdauer</span>
            <strong>Kompakte Vitalparameter</strong>
